			"widgets_values":[
				"yemian,This image is a vibrant, digital illustration of a traditional Japanese market scene. The background features a serene, picturesque landscape with a clear blue sky, fluffy white clouds, and a distant mountain range. In the foreground, a bustling market is depicted with red and orange traditional Japanese buildings with tiled roofs, adorned with lanterns and banners. The buildings are situated on either side of a winding, blue river that reflects the surrounding scenery.\n\nThe central focus of the image is a vibrant red and blue promotional banner with various products and offers. The banner is divided into sections, each showcasing different items with prices and descriptions. The products include traditional Japanese sweets, snacks, and souvenirs, all presented in a whimsical, cartoonish style with bold, colorful graphics and shadows that give them a three-dimensional appearance.\n\nThe overall aesthetic of the image is cheerful and lively, with a mix of traditional and modern elements, capturing a festive and inviting atmosphere. The use of warm, earthy tones in the buildings and cool, bright hues in the sky and water create a visually appealing contrast. The illustration is highly detailed, with textures and shading that enhance the sense of depth and realism, making it a visually engaging and immersive experience."
